<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Gold Fields Coal Dec qtr pre-capex up.</title>
<headline>Gold Fields Coal Dec qtr pre-capex up.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-Dec versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit before capital spending   20.89 vs 20.59</p>
<p>    Capital spending			    4.56 vs  8.53</p>
<p>    Sales				     84.96  vs 78.36</p>
<p>    Cost of sales			   58.89  vs 59.58</p>
<p>    Coal produced (tonnes)	   2,376,000 vs 2,323,000</p>
<p>    Coal sold (tonnes)		 2,334,000 vs 2,333,000</p>
<p>Full name: Gold Fields Coal Ltd, part of Gold Fields of South Africa Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
